<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P upgrades Australia's PUMA issue to AAA.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P upgrades Australia's PUMA issue to AAA.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Wednesday it has raised the rating on the class A registered stock issue by PUMA sub-fund No.2 to AAA from AA plus.</p>
<p>The AA minus rating on the Class B registered stock issued by PUMA sub-fund No.2 is affirmed.</p>
</text>
